            "variations": "<h3>🔒 Confidentiality Notice</h3><p>All personal information provided in this form will remain strictly confidential and used solely for adoption screening and rescue-related purposes by Bubbles Pets Rescue. It will not be shared, published, or disclosed to any third party.</p>"
